        "ActionId": 9,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Discord",
            "...Mission Report: Day 182 post-disaster, Las Prados' defensive perimeter collapsed. Neilis Air Force Base fully overrun by the Corrupted. Critical intel remains unsecured—potential exposure threatens operational integrity.",
