    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "Anyway... would you mind ditching that ridiculous mask?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Discord",
            "This is part of my battlefield sensor suite. It's designed to work in sync with human immune and regulatory systems.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 18,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "She keeps her real reason to herself: fully revealing her face would only expose more emotion—exactly what she wants to avoid right now."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "Ugh...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 20,
        "ActionId": 20,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "Anyway, your isolation review is over. Dismissed!",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 21,
        "ActionId": 21,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Discord",
            "Where to after dismissal?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "This is your transfer order. You're now part of the Purifying Force under direct command of Military HQ. First, report to Commander Nikola. If anything else comes up, take it to your new captain—Bianca.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Collins swipes across the screen a few times with his thick-knuckled fingers, then turns the terminal toward Discord to display the official document."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
