    {
        "Id": 28,
        "ActionId": 28,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "",
            "The gaunt man, silent until now as he leans against the wall, straightens up and fixes his gaze on Collins."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 29,
        "ActionId": 29,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "Are you sure this is the right way to settle things?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 30,
        "ActionId": 30,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "She's done more than fulfill her duty. Thanks to Punishing, that old pest Monzano is no longer our concern, and Discord's unwavering loyalty has only confirmed it once again.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 31,
        "ActionId": 31,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "With a slow, deliberate motion, Collins pulls out a pouch of chewing tobacco, tears open the wrapper, and tips the gray-brown pellets into his mouth."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 32,
        "ActionId": 32,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "As for Palangoski...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 33,
        "ActionId": 33,
        "Type": 401,
        "Params": [
            2,
            4095
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "He aggressively scrunches the wrapping paper into a wad and casually flings it into the trash can under the table, not giving it a second thought."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2,
            8
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "Hmph...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "His companion catches on right away, yet he still breathes out a soft sigh."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "Leave the old world's affairs to the old world.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 40,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "Bro, you're pretty smart.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 41,
        "ActionId": 41,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "He maintains that cruel grin, as though he's wearing the unchanging mask of a Greek tragedian."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 42,
        "ActionId": 42,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "Anyway, I'll deal with that old lady's problem later.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 43,
        "ActionId": 43,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "Since the outbreak, the fighting on the surface is largely under control. Our main priority is making sure our people reclaim those key positions of authority.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 44,
        "ActionId": 44,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            14
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 45,
        "ActionId": 45,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "This deal is supposed to be our once-in-a-lifetime chance. Who would have guessed Trillard would give his life for the cause in such a devastating way? If only we all had that kind of resolve...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 46,
        "ActionId": 46,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "...I still can't shake the feeling that something's off.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 47,
        "ActionId": 47,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "With a skeptical edge to his voice, Liszt cuts right through the hollow sentiment."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 48,
        "ActionId": 48,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 49,
        "ActionId": 49,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "When did you turn into such a worrywart?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 50,
        "ActionId": 50,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Everyone who's ever teamed up with him is accustomed to his confrontational style, but Liszt simply goes on sharing his ideas."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 51,
        "ActionId": 51,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "You're right. Protecting every seat on the Parliament is absolutely vital to us.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 52,
        "ActionId": 52,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "So in the midst of the Great Evacuation, we marshal vast transport fleets and armed units to guarantee that those World Government officials and lawmakers loyal to Kurono reach Babylonia safely.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 53,
        "ActionId": 53,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "But after Kephart brings Discord back from the Las Prados Spaceport to Kurono, he simply vanishes.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 54,
        "ActionId": 54,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "He picks up the terminal on the desk, brings up Discord's report, and skims through the details."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 55,
        "ActionId": 55,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "...there's no record of his whereabouts. His last known appearance was on the day of the outbreak.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 56,
        "ActionId": 56,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "Maybe they're living under an alias. Day in and day out, they're buried under secret dealings—bet you know exactly how that feels, huh bro?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 57,
        "ActionId": 57,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "Wouldn't it be nice if someday I could just live as a regular person, drifting along without a care? There's really nothing bad about that at all.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 58,
        "ActionId": 58,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 59,
        "ActionId": 59,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "Instead of a disposable playboy, I'm more interested in the one pulling the strings behind him.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 60,
        "ActionId": 60,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2,
            5
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 61,
        "ActionId": 61,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "In a heartbeat, the man's gaze sharpens with fierce resolve."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 62,
        "ActionId": 62,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "This is yet another red flag. Whoever is pulling the strings behind Kephart...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 63,
        "ActionId": 63,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "Up to now, we've had no confirmation of Trout's location.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 64,
        "ActionId": 64,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "Want to hear the truth from me?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 65,
        "ActionId": 65,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liszt",
            "Do I really have any other option?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 66,
        "ActionId": 66,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Collins gives a sharp, icy chuckle."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 67,
        "ActionId": 67,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "Someone that fascinated by this research—even before the outbreak—can't just be a curious writer.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 68,
        "ActionId": 68,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "If he really is still alive, then when we finally meet again...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 69,
        "ActionId": 69,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Collins",
            "We have to decide how to harness his power for Kurono.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 70,
        "ActionId": 70,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Liszt sets the terminal down on the table. He purses his lips, as though he's turning over their last exchange in his mind."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 71,
        "ActionId": 71,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
